28038202.026000","attachments":[{"fallback":"デザインセミナーで学生がグラフィック・レコーディング担当を続けています／造形学部 | News\u0026amp;Topics | 常葉大学","id":1,"title":"デザインセミナーで学生がグラフィック・レコーディング担当を続けています／造形学部 | News\u0026amp;Topics | 常葉大学","title_link":"https://www.tokoha-u.ac.jp/archive-news/150527/","text":"10学部19学科、静岡県内最大規模の総合大学「常葉大学」。静岡市・浜松市に設置する4つのキャンパスには、幅広い学びと新しい未来が待っています。","blocks":null,"service_name":"tokoha-u.ac.jp","service_icon":"https://www.tokoha-u.ac.jp/common-archive/image/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.tokoha-u.ac.jp/archive-news/150527/","original_url":"https://www.tokoha-u.ac.jp/archive-news/150527/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Sog5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae48a693-93e1-4114-9e49-46951f38c7ba","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"過去にグラレコを検討したことはありました(断念したけど","ts":"1628038103.024500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qsFb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cf85449-5b77-443c-900c-43cfafd4f49c","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"meetup規模だと星の数ほどあるので書き起こしはアリなのかも","ts":"1628038061.023800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q4Ftj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"438174f7-0cdc-40b7-8f92-32f0ead34b4c","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"こたつ記事っていうんですね、初耳でした","ts":"1628037945.022600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fGr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C4E76B91-E5BC-4737-8B03-7DBC9EC93C58","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"こたつ記事？","ts":"1628037879.022100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YiLVJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BA9517CB-5664-4C21-8235-97C5DF2F3D4E","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"イベントの内容が書き起こされるのって貴重だし（それでなければトゥギャッターまとめとかしかない）","ts":"1628037786.021800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":